        "title": "The news media have too much influence on people's lives today and this is a negative development. To what extent do you agree or disagree?",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>The news media have too much influence on people's lives today and this is a negative development. To what extent do you agree or disagree?</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Media influence on society <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZXCTdIwYfoEHiYxN02ilInbigxc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Media influence on society cho 1 quan điểm:</strong> C&aacute;c phương tiện truyền th&ocirc;ng tin tức c&oacute; qu&aacute; nhiều ảnh hưởng đến cuộc sống của mọi người ng&agrave;y nay v&agrave; đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng ti&ecirc;u cực.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E3ZGdHNbvo7a5Xx13JCl7W0YgIf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Bạn đồng &yacute; hay kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với &yacute; kiến n&agrave;y?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G2WQdS3ZBo0EqjxQ0E6lWFRcgag\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Media influence on society v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F528dFEjBo6SNZxoRhwltZTugjE\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HmfndoSPQowoGTxD5NxlDXDHg8e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mn9bdR5NqoPxjfxpiRdlL4L3gXg\"><em>(*) Bạn học&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-to-what-extent\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">c&aacute;ch viết Introduction cho dạng To what extent </span></a></strong>ở đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;.</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KZH7dfmkgoHhTWxRag7lCbaHgPf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WxkxdSg0moGTKxxQC9ClmVX7gIe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>exert excessive influence <em>(g&acirc;y ảnh hưởng qu&aacute; mức)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WxkxdSg0moGTKxxQC9ClmVX7gIe\" data-list=\"bullet\">constitute a negative trend <em>(l&agrave; một xu hướng ti&ecirc;u cực)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">Bạn n&ecirc;n n&oacute;i r&otilde; quan điểm của m&igrave;nh l&agrave; đồng &yacute;, hoặc kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm của đề. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm '<strong>đồng &yacute;'</strong>, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng <strong>\"Mặc d&ugrave; sự ph&aacute;t triển n&agrave;y mang lại một số lợi &iacute;ch nhất định, t&ocirc;i tin rằng những mặt tr&aacute;i nghi&ecirc;m trọng hơn nhiều.\"</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MvJpdBfVJoVwjCxvq9qlilBMged\"><em>(*) Bạn t&igrave;m hiểu về bản chất của <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> ở b&agrave;i học thử n&agrave;y nh&eacute;: <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cach-lap-luan-4060\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic lập luận dạng 'To What Extent'</a></strong></span></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8hBdo0PeoqsShxLrO2lVfjLggg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận Partly Agree</strong> th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DJ7UdTfc8oo2WyxIphSljunsgDe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về một số lợi &iacute;ch nhỏ m&agrave; c&aacute;c phương tiện truyền th&ocirc;ng tin tức mang lại.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vt2udEiR3otV1NxclTqllVpUgDc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng ti&ecirc;u cực với những t&aacute;c hại đ&aacute;ng kể.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>B&agrave;n về một số lợi &iacute;ch nhỏ m&agrave; c&aacute;c phương tiện truyền th&ocirc;ng tin tức mang lại.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, việc thương mại h&oacute;a c&aacute;c sự kiện thể thao c&oacute; những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực nhất định</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PpnQdgecGorUQ9xqsaulsoDkgNh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SSJRdsOQtoG7mJxddeXldVAIgyc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: &nbsp;Thứ nhất, n&oacute; gi&uacute;p c&ocirc;ng d&acirc;n <em>cập nhật th&ocirc;ng tin về (stay updated on)</em> c&aacute;c diễn biến quan trọng, cho ph&eacute;p họ đưa ra quyết định s&aacute;ng suốt về cuộc sống v&agrave; cộng đồng của m&igrave;nh.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-INZedPXZIoDxdVx6GXIl6kCYgQb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Điều n&agrave;y <em>tăng cường sự tham gia d&acirc;n chủ v&agrave; cam kết c&ocirc;ng d&acirc;n (strengthen democratic participation and civic engagement</em>), khi mọi người trở n&ecirc;n nhận thức r&otilde; hơn về c&aacute;c vấn đề ch&iacute;nh trị v&agrave; x&atilde; hội ảnh hưởng đến họ.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JSD9dGbNiorQORx8xSwlhZVLg5b\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YQygdQYwUom7iexF14hlO2dkgDd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Thứ hai, c&aacute;c chương tr&igrave;nh tin tức cung cấp nội dung giải tr&iacute; mang đến sự thư gi&atilde;n sau những ng&agrave;y căng thẳng.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X4mDdsOcXoolKVx1QFjl4Ir2gyc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> V&igrave; mọi người cần những khoảng thời gian nghỉ ngơi tinh thần khỏi &aacute;p lực c&ocirc;ng việc v&agrave; học tập, việc ti&ecirc;u thụ truyền th&ocirc;ng tin tức gi&uacute;p <em>duy tr&igrave; sự c&acirc;n bằng giữa c&ocirc;ng việc v&agrave; cuộc sống (maintain work-life balance)</em> v&agrave;<em> giảm căng thẳng th&ocirc;ng qua c&aacute;c phần nhẹ nh&agrave;ng hơn (reduces stress through lighter segments)</em> v&agrave; những c&acirc;u chuyện về con người.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng sự ph&aacute;t triển của m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh v&agrave; điện thoại đ&atilde; mang lợi những lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể cho khả năng đọc viết của giới trẻ.</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, &nbsp;t&ocirc;i tin chắc rằng những ưu điểm n&agrave;y bị vượt trội nhiều bởi những hậu quả ti&ecirc;u cực.&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SFw6dSGEGoRcSSxYg3glmCgUgac\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WduxdLYRlouMz3x9cZYlxJxAgje\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>Một mối lo ngại lớn l&agrave; th&ocirc;ng tin sai lệch lan truyền nhanh hơn <em>những sự thật đ&atilde; được x&aacute;c minh (verified facts) </em>qua c&aacute;c k&ecirc;nh truyền th&ocirc;ng hiện đại.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NwBjdg29WoaKIDxNhPGl7MGpgbd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:&nbsp;</strong>Bởi v&igrave; <em>c&aacute;c cơ quan truyền th&ocirc;ng (media outlets</em>) ưu ti&ecirc;n tốc độ hơn độ ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c để cạnh tranh về lượt xem v&agrave; nhấp chuột, c&ocirc;ng ch&uacute;ng trở n&ecirc;n bối rối v&agrave; đưa ra những quyết định tồi dựa tr&ecirc;n <em>th&ocirc;ng tin g&acirc;y hiểu lầm (misleading information)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SfNydu4h7oYzAYx4ZyVl57ZBgKf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YLs1dL1D7o7jbHxj8NElcItIgOB\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Hơn nữa, c&aacute;c cơ quan tin tức tập trung qu&aacute; mức v&agrave;o <em>những c&acirc;u chuyện giật g&acirc;n v&agrave; bi kịch (sensational stories and tragedies)</em>, v&igrave; nội dung như vậy tạo ra tỷ suất xem cao hơn v&agrave; doanh thu quảng c&aacute;o.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWgmdHBiaoCL70xLVzHlqO01gYg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> <em>việc tiếp x&uacute;c li&ecirc;n tục (constant exposure)</em> với nội dung ti&ecirc;u cực n&agrave;y tạo ra một thế giới quan bi quan v&agrave; l&agrave;m tăng lo &acirc;u trong số người xem.\"</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MBiidSgyBoGG3yxZF4Bl60qlg2f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TcZnd99dmoDoeqx1VbLlL8Lhgve\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">rapid spread of misinformation <em>(sự lan truyền nhanh ch&oacute;ng của th&ocirc;ng tin sai lệch)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TcZnd99dmoDoeqx1VbLlL8Lhgve\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">harm public wellbeing <em>(g&acirc;y hại cho sức khỏe cộng đồng)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2599,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>Opinions are divided on whether the news media exert excessive influence over people's lives and whether this constitutes a negative trend. Although this development offers certain benefits, I believe the drawbacks are far more significant.</p>",
            "question_id": 24743,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2600,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p><strong>Admittedly, the strong influence of news media can be advantageous in several ways.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Firstly, it helps citizens stay updated on crucial developments happening locally and globally, enabling them to make informed decisions about their lives and communities. This strengthens democratic participation and civic engagement, as people become more aware of political and social issues that directly affect them and can respond appropriately.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Secondly, news programs offer leisure content that provides entertainment and relaxation after stressful days at work or school. Since people need mental breaks from constant work and study pressures to maintain their wellbeing, consuming news media helps maintain work-life balance and reduces stress through lighter segments and human interest stories that offer pleasant distractions.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 24743,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2601,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p><strong>However, I am convinced that these advantages are far outweighed by the negative consequences.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">To begin with, one major concern is that false information spreads faster than verified facts through modern media channels. Since media outlets prioritize speed over accuracy to compete for clicks and views in the digital age, the public becomes confused and often makes poor decisions based on misleading information that appears credible. For example, during health crises, unverified claims about miracle treatments can lead people to dangerous choices that harm their health. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, news outlets focus excessively on sensational stories and tragedies, as such content generates higher ratings and advertising revenue that sustain their business operations. Consequently, constant exposure to this negative content creates a pessimistic worldview and increases anxiety among viewers, affecting their mental health and overall quality of life.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 24743,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2602,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p>In conclusion, although the news media's significant influence provides some benefits in terms of information access and entertainment, I believe these are overshadowed by serious problems, including the rapid spread of misinformation and the promotion of negative content that harms mental wellbeing.</p>",
            "question_id": 24743,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
